{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE EARTH NEEDS YOUR HELP!</strong> <br> <br><i>Planet Keeper Program</i> is a program created by the government to prepare humans against different levels of threat. Help us create the best defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With different levels, enemies and dangerous bosses, you need to spend your resources in the best way to improve your powerful laser.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAMEPLAY:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat... many times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES (demo):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+30 upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music to vibe with</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079190?t=1760319256","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079190?t=1760319256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079190/317fda9193011238cb5a7bd99d9a82d95ae6b002/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760319256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079190/317fda9193011238cb5a7bd99d9a82d95ae6b002/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760319256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"descri